{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"sunshi-e-o012b","title":"孙坚设酒会执斩南阳太守张咨","accounts":[{"id":"sunshi-e-o012b-account","label":"《孙破虏讨逆传第一》正文","text":"孙坚设酒会执斩南阳太守张咨","evidence":["sunshi-e-o012b-q"]},{"id":"sunshi-e-p014a-account","label":"《吴历》","text":"孙坚诈病诱张咨至营执斩","evidence":["sunshi-e-p014a-q"]},{"id":"dongliu-a-701e79786d1604a48454","label":"裴注·零陵先贤传","text":"孙坚举兵讨董卓杀张咨","evidence":["dongliu-q-efdaf98c4854f63628d7"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0119","role":"设宴执斩","evidence":["sunshi-e-o012b-q"]},{"person":"sunshi-p0020","role":"被杀","evidence":["sunshi-e-o012b-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0053","role":"孙坚举兵所讨者","evidence":["dongliu-q-efdaf98c4854f63628d7"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"诸州郡起兵讨卓时","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["sunshi-e-o012b-q"]},"ordering_evidence":"sunshi-e-o012b-q","source_order":[46,82,"O012b"],"order":8031}],"persons":[{"id":"sunshi-p0020","name":"张咨","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0053","name":"董卓","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0119","name":"孙坚","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"dongliu-q-efdaf98c4854f63628d7","section":"chapter-039","block":"b-79d23173cd059594a6bb","layer":"pei","quote":"时孙坚举兵讨董卓，以南阳太守张咨不给军粮，杀之","attribution":"裴注·零陵先贤传","section_title":"董刘马陈董吕传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0084.xhtml","index":56,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-2e5c4ea3c83f130fd0a8","start":36,"end":59,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"sunshi-e-o012b-q","section":"chapter-046","block":"b-84cf62d2b7cd8fe12d65","layer":"original","quote":"比至南阳〖3〗，众数万人。南阳太守张咨闻军至，晏然自若。﹝三﹞坚以牛酒礼咨〖4〗。咨明日，亦答诣坚〖5〗。酒酣，长沙主簿入白坚〖6〗：“前移南阳〖7〗，而道路不治，军资不具〖8〗；请收主簿，推问意故〖9〗！”咨大惧，欲去；兵陈四周，不得出。有顷〖10〗，主簿复入白坚：“南阳太守稽停义兵，使贼不时讨；请收出，按军法从事〖11〗！”便牵咨于军门斩之〖12〗。郡中震栗，无求不获。","section_title":"孙破虏讨逆传第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0099.xhtml","index":81,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":63,"end":251,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"sunshi-e-p014a-q","section":"chapter-046","block":"b-a29c5a0fa23cc3bc9c79","layer":"pei","quote":"初，坚至南阳，咨既不给军粮，又不肯见坚。坚欲进兵，恐有后患；乃诈得急疾，举军震惶；迎呼巫医，祷祀山川。遣所亲人说咨，言病困，欲以兵付咨。咨闻之，心利其兵，即将步骑五六百人，诣营省坚。坚卧与相见，无何，猝然而起；按剑骂咨，遂执斩之。","attribution":"《吴历》","section_title":"孙破虏讨逆传第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0099.xhtml","index":126,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-6acb6f44d7cdb2100594","start":10,"end":125,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
